cale is constant across a batch/inference step and preloaded as a host-side scalar, or does it vary per call/head?\\\",\\n    \\\"What are the practical limits for shared memory and register usage imposed by the surrounding runtime/occupancy targets on MI300X?\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\\n\\n[KSEARCH HIP HARD CONSTRAINTS]\\n- main.cpp MUST NOT contain kernel launch syntax `<<< >>>`.\\n- main.cpp MUST NOT call `hipLaunchKernelGGL`.\\n- main.cpp must call host launch wrappers declared in kernel.h with this pattern:\\n  `hipError_t ksearch_launch_<kernel>(dim3 grid, dim3 block, size_t shared_mem, hipStream_t stream, ...);`\\n- kernel.cu must implement those wrappers and perform actual `<<< >>>` launches there.\\n- Do NOT include private HIP headers under `hip/amd_detail/*`.\\n- Use only public HIP headers like `<hip/hip_runtime.h>`, `<hip/hip_bfloat16.h>`, `<hip/hip_fp8.h>` when needed.\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.3-codex\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}"}}, "request_meta": {"model": "gpt-5.3-codex", "reasoning": {"effort": "high"}}, "response": {"http_version": "HTTP/1.1", "headers": [["Date", "Mon, 23 Mar 2026 07:43:13 GMT"], ["Content-Type", "application/json"], ["Transfer-Encoding", "chunked"], ["Connection", "keep-alive"], ["Server", "cloudflare"], ["x-ratelimit-limit-requests", "15000"], ["x-ratelimit-limit-tokens", "40000000"], ["x-ratelimit-remaining-requests", "14999"], ["x-ratelimit-remaining-tokens", "39986796"], ["x-ratelimit-reset-requests", "4ms"], ["x-ratelimit-reset-tokens", "19ms"], ["openai-version", "2020-10-01"], ["openai-organization", "user-1cxdgrbvyzsglmmbqabhwk1k"], ["openai-project", "proj_XNNf74ZO7x4HoDwE8wx7GRzr"], ["x-request-id", "req_6544aeab4bf345c4b999cdb2c4270fce"], ["openai-processing-ms", "223846"], ["cf-cache-status", "DYNAMIC"], ["set-cookie", "__cf_bm=g_h2xzLmC38NUHO4SD_7rDcs4eKN3rD7QQOyVJRe2i4-1774251569.852359-1.0.1.1-6r.royBfST8yc8WHJSS4AtPBmyi7LsgEIhOjI3KhJfEj5YeuEtwva1uUxj.v3MGUY1nDem4LwVIItY6llBGVsemkUCUr4CFev.4dQyKPjLKK18Zgrau6rsWyRf1oTAKi